<LegalPage
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How WeldWork collects, uses, and protects your information when you use our website or contact us."
>
  <p>WeldWork ("we", "us") operates weldwork.in. This policy explains what information we collect and how we handle it.</p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact & quote requests:</strong> name, phone number, email, message, and any photos you attach when requesting a quote.</li>
    <li><strong>Reviews:</strong> the name, rating, and message you submit publicly on our site.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> basic, non-identifying analytics about page visits.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not create user accounts, and we do not collect payment details through this website.</p>

  <h2>How We Use It</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to enquiries and prepare quotes.</li>
    <li>To display reviews and ratings on the site.</li>
    <li>To improve the website and our services.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Supabase:</strong> stores quote requests and review submissions.</li>
    <li><strong>Web3Forms:</strong> relays contact form messages to our email.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare Turnstile:</strong> spam protection on forms (no advertising tracking).</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare:</strong> hosting, security, and aggregate analytics.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These providers process data only as needed to deliver their services.</p>

  <h2>Data Retention & Security</h2>
  <p>Enquiries and quotes are kept while relevant for our business relationship. Uploaded photos are stored in a restricted folder and only used to assess your request. We apply reasonable technical measures to protect the data we hold.</p>

  <h2>Your Choices</h2>
  <p>You may ask us to correct or delete your personal information at any time — call <a href="tel:+919840562997">+91 98405 62997</a> or email <a href="mailto:contact@weldwork.in">contact@weldwork.in</a>. Reviews you submitted can also be removed on request.</p>

